  "dialogueList": [
    {
      "dialogue": {
        "EncounterObjectGuid": "73df8d9c-a274-48fd-98c9-2bd0d7860e83"
      },
      "name": "Dialog_MissionStart",
      "overrideDialogueBucketId": "",
      "dialogueContent": [
        {
          "words": "To be completely honest with you, I haven't the faintest idea what kind of research goes on here. Nevertheless, a credible threat has been made. Your opposition is a mercenary company using the rather grandiose name \"[[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreGrayDeath],Gray Death Legion]].\"",
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_KuritaRepDefault",
          "audioName": "NONE"
        },
        {
          "words": "Huh. I've heard of them. Made a name for themselves on the Lyran and Draconis border. Their commander is supposed to be a hot-shit tactician.",
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_YangDefault",
          "audioName": "NONE"
        },
        {
          "words": "Imagine me rolling my eyes dramatically. At any rate, my people tell me there are at least two lances of enemy 'Mechs on the surface, advancing toward your position. I have inbound aerospace support, so all you need to do is hold out until it arrives.",
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_KuritaRepDefault",
          "audioName": "NONE",
          "cameraFocusGuid": "4d39e72c-4f99-4cc6-8fe0-d4d18cad0063"
        },
        {
          "words": "Keep the facility intact, and hold out for the cavalry. Shouldn't be a problem, Shugo Yamaguchi.",
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_DariusDefault",
          "audioName": "NONE",
          "cameraFocusGuid": "dafd0d98-c88a-4f90-b137-4fe5ed94ebbb"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dialogue": {
        "EncounterObjectGuid": "4011a4c3-cba2-4d22-b2b3-3b19a3297ab9"
      },
      "name": "Dialog_MissionSuccess",
      "overrideDialogueBucketId": "",
      "dialogueContent": [
        {
          "words": "Commander, this is Grayson Carlyle. That was a hell of an ass kicking. Glad we were in salvaged 'Mechs. Listen, I don't have a bone to pick with you; I just need what's in that facility. I've got reinforcements landing shortly and— [static]",
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_UW_redHunter_CarlyleDefault",
          "audioName": "NONE"
        },
        {
          "words": "Mercenary Commander: this is the Draconis [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreISF],Internal Security Force]]. We are interdicting this world in pursuit of the wanted criminal Grayson Carlyle. Do not attempt to enter orbit, or you will be fired on.",
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_UW_redHunter_DESTDefault",
          "audioName": "NONE"
        },
        {
          "words": "What the— Boss, I've got multiple lock-ons coming from the surface. They've got me in their crosshairs. What the hell is this?",
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_SumireDefault",
          "audioName": "NONE"
        },
        {
          "words": "Commander, will someone please tell me what's going on down there? I can't contact my people, and the JumpShip captain isn't answering— [static]",
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_KuritaRepDefault",
          "audioName": "NONE"
        },
        {
          "words": "Darius? We just lost the comms relay signal from the system's JumpShip. Either it was destroyed, or it just jumped out.",
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_FarahDefault",
          "audioName": "NONE"
        },
        {
          "words": "Additionally, our communications are being disrupted by a ground installation. We can relay messages through the Leopard, but only over short distances.",
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_FarahDefault",
          "audioName": "NONE"
        },
        {
          "words": "What the hell is— Combine forces, we're <i>on your side</i>. Stand down, we're the good guys!",
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_DariusDefault",
          "audioName": "NONE"
        },
        {
          "words": "<i>Shit!</i> Boss, they just fired a PPC off the Leopard's bow. I'm going nap-of-the-earth to try to shake them.",
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_SumireDefault",
          "audioName": "NONE"
        },
        {
          "words": "I don't want to say \"I told you so,\" but… I think we just got double-crossed. They're after Carlyle, but I bet we're acceptable collateral damage.",
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_YangDefault",
          "audioName": "NONE"
        },
        {
          "words": "Commander, we need to pull Carlyle's ass out of the fire if we're going to figure out what the hell is going on. Let's get to him before the Combine does.",
          "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_DariusDefault",
          "audioName": "NONE"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dialogue": {
        "EncounterObjectGuid": "d3d33d95-9ed7-4686-b9eb-954ebe51cc02"
      },
